==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|yue}} {{term|雜碎||mixed and broken|tr=zaap6 seoi3|lang=yue|sc=Hani}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{US}} A [[stir-fried]] vegetable dish, served with pieces of beef or pork in a semi-thick sauce, and often soy sauce.
# {{Canada|and|British}} Steamed [[bean]] [[sprouts]] served in a semi-thick sauce, and mixed with a choice of meat and/or vegetables.

